The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

convdiff1

  solve:

    u dc/dx - d/dx ( alpha * dc/dx ) + gamma c = f on (0,L)

  using a FEM (Galerkin, SU, SUPG) with a uniform grid

convdiff2

  solve:

    u dc/dx - d/dx ( alpha * dc/dx ) + gamma c = f on (0,L)

  using a spectral element method with a uniform grid
